WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,260
Wasn't it very arrogant to box yesterday?

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,420
Why are you so humble and begging for help now?

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,213
sisters

4
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:07,591
There's nothing we can do

5
00:00:07,591 --> 00:00:10,762
I can only support you mentally

6
00:00:10,762 --> 00:00:13,140
Hold on yourself!

7
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:18,390
Others were just thankful that they were temporarily safe, but Liu Tiantian's incident also reminded everyone.

8
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:23,250
If they continue to fight on their own, sooner or later they will be liquidated by Chen Zhenghao Ege.

9
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:29,490
The more the trend gets worse, the more people gather in small groups. There are only six or seven people in total, and they must have bad intentions.

10
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:34,420
Business will soon be raided by Eger. We must work together to protect ourselves.

11
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:37,020
It's quite safe for me to live alone and I don't need to hang out with others.

12
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,415
You can't say that

13
00:00:38,415 --> 00:00:40,043
you are alone

14
00:00:40,043 --> 00:00:43,765
Chen Zhenghao's five or six men also have water guns and weapons.

15
00:00:43,765 --> 00:00:45,160
You are also in danger

16
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:49,910
Danger? Why don’t you ask around? Who made Chen Zhenghao’s fists and legs?
